    I''m here to help. What happened to your dad?","parentUIDs":[1,2],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":10}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":-41.99936,"yPos":454.334167},"ID":8,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Okay,
    stay calm. I''m sending help right now. What''s your location?","parentUIDs":[3,7],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":690.332764,"yPos":385.46698},"ID":11,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Okay,
    stay calm. I''m sending help right now. What''s your location?","parentUIDs":[5,6],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":14},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":934.0019,"yPos":530.667664},"ID":13,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Got
    it. Is he breathing?","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":18}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":943.0013,"yPos":735.6674},"ID":15,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"We
    need to start CPR. Do you know how to do it?","parentUIDs":[10,14],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":22}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":685.999634,"yPos":921.669861},"ID":17,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"That''s
    okay. I''ll guide you. Put the heel of your hand on the center of the chest.
    Place your other hand on top of the first, interlocking your fingers. Keep your
    arms straight and position your shoulders directly above your hands. You need
    to push hard and fast. At least 2 inches deep at a rate of 100 - 120 beats per
    minute.","parentUIDs":[16],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":951.0015,"yPos":920.669861},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Good.
    Begin chest compressions - hard and fast. At least 2 inches deep and  100 - 120
    beats per minute. Is there an AED around?","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1175.009,"yPos":739.6672},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Good.
    Keep an eye on his breathing. Help is on the way.","parentUIDs":[20],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":679.9995,"yPos":1142.6731},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Do
    you have an AED nearby?","parentUIDs":[22],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"911
    Operator","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":28}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":926.0005,"yPos":1314.67114},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"That''s
